WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
Xiaotie, go to the door and wait for a while.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,880
Let me ask the immortal something

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,880
What are you asking? You are so happy

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,880
I won’t go with you tonight

5
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,200
Be careful when riding your bike

6
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,080
I don’t know when you can come back

7
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,080
I still want to go to the county town to do some business tomorrow morning.

8
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,930
Uncle, I'll lend you a bowl of the car. You can take the money.

9
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:18,370
This kid is too polite

10
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,420
Uncle, the money was collected so easily.

11
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,540
Don't speak next

12
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,460
Someone will speak for you

13
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,800
The old fairy has experienced a mountain breeze.

14
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:33,880
Immortal family, let me stop it

15
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,930
Why are you snoring?

16
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,610
No, you didn't let me talk?

17
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:45,690
My fairy family has arrived at your hall

18
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:47,770
My name and ability were all given back to me.

19
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:49,330
I will write directly about Tang Dan

20
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:51,090
I feel good when I offer it at home

21
00:00:51,870 --> 00:00:52,790
That's it

22
00:00:53,270 --> 00:00:55,510
It used to be black, why did it turn red?

23
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:56,870
They were all ghosts before

24
00:00:57,070 --> 00:00:58,950
Didn’t I give you some of my old immortals?

25
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:00,870
All four, two or eight pillars are complete, and they are all red.

26
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:02,390
What, you doubt me?

27
00:01:02,630 --> 00:01:03,990
Don't dare. I'll leave first.

28
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:05,720
Do you want to learn skills?

29
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,520
Apprenticeship 8888

30
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,080
Three buckles and nine bows, the apprenticeship ceremony

31
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:10,560
I teach you how to capture the soul of a painting

32
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:12,320
You are my only closing door

33
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,300
No need, Wang Daxian

34
00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:16,540
I don’t care, I don’t have that big ambition

35
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,580
Go back and offer it, don't get wet

36
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:19,620
It won’t work if it gets wet.

37
00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:21,380
Five thousand yuan to buy a piece of tattered paper

38
00:01:22,230 --> 00:01:23,510
What's going on?

39
00:01:29,250 --> 00:01:30,210
Why are you here again?

40
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,040
I obviously slept at home

41
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:33,360
I can't stay here anymore

42
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,560
I want to leave. If I don’t leave, I won’t leave.

43
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:36,880
I'm going to die here

44
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,760
Iron box, what else does grandpa hide?
